<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">Zephaniah</book>
  <para style="h">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zephaniah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda-te lal Amona fapa Josia lal laia Lalpa thu Zephania, Kusia fapa, Gedalia fapa, Amaria fapa, Hezekia fapa hnêna lo thleng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lei chung ata thil zawng zawng ka tiral vek ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihring leh sate ka tiral ang a; Chunglêng savate leh tuipui sanghate ka tiral ang a; Mi sualte chu ka titlu ang a; Lei chung ata mihring ka tibo daih ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Juda-te leh Jerusalem luahtute zawng zawng chungah Ka kut ka lek ang a; he hmun aṭang hian Baala la awm chhunte, Kemarim hming chu puithiamho chawpin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In chung chhîpa vân lam thilho hnêna kûn ṭhînte, Lalpa hnêna chhechhama Malkama chhâla chham bawka kûn ṭhînte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa hawisantute leh Lalpa zawng lova, Amah râwn lotute chu ka tibo daih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian hmaah chuan ngawi reng rawh, Lalpa ni chu a hnaih tâk avângin. Lalpa chuan inthawina a buatsaih tawh a, A mi sâwmte pawh a tithianghlim tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa inthawina nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Hotute leh lal fapate leh hnam dang silhfêna Inthuamte zawng zawng chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan kawngka zuankahlên zawng zawng, An hotute inpâwngnêkna leh bumnaa tikhattute chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan, Sangha Kawngka aṭanga au thâwm te, Miseneh aṭanga chiau vak vak te, tlâng aṭanga ri hum hum te a awm ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Maktesh mite u, Kanaan mi zawng zawng an boral avângin chiau vak vak rawh u! Tangkaraw phurtute zawng zawng an boral vek tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chumi hunah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Khawnvar chhiin Jerusalem ka zawng chhuak ang a; Uain mawng nawi anga awm mai maia, an rilrua, ‘ Lalpa chuan a chhia a ṭha tih a nei ngai nêm,’ titute chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, an sumte chu râllâkah a la chang ang a, An inte chu a ram ang; a ni, inte an sa ang a; mahse, an luah lo vang; Grêp huante an siam ang a; mahse, a uain chu an in lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa ni ropui tak chu a hnai e, a hnaiin a thleng thuai dâwn a ni. Lalpa ni thâwm chu râpthlâk tak a ni; Chutah chuan mi chak chu a chiau vak vak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chumi ni chu thinurna ni a ni a, Mangan leh hrehawm ni, chhiatna leh ṭiauna ni, Thimna leh khaw dur ni, chhûm leh thim chhah mup ni a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kulha hung khawpuite chungah leh khaw kil kulh sângte chungah chuan, tawtawrâwt leh râl bei thâwm rîkna ni a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tin, mihringte chungah hrehawmna ka rawn thlen ang a, Mitdel ang maiin an kal ang, Lalpa chungah an sual avângin; An thisen chu vaivut angin ka leih bua ang a, An tisate pawh êkdûr ang maiin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa thinurna nîah chuan an rangkachak emaw, An tangkarua emaw pawhin anmahni a chhan chhuak thei lo vang a; Ram pum pui hi a thîkna meiah chuan a kâng bo vek ang. Rama chêngte zawng zawng a tibo dâwn a, A ni, tihbona râpthlâk tak a siam dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw hnam zah nachâng hre lote u, Thuruat a lo chhuah hma leh, nî chu favai ang maia a ral hma leh, Lalpa thinrimna hlauhawm tak chu in chunga a lo thlen hma leh, Lalpa thinrimna ni chu in chunga a lo thlen hma hian, Tlân khâwm rawh u, a ni, tlân khâwm huai huai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangni leia mi thuhnuairawlh zawng zawng, a thu awihtute u, Lalpa chu zawng rawh u; Felna zawng ula, thuhnuairawlh tum rawh u; Lalpa thinrimna nîah chuan thuhrûkin in awm thei mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gaza khua chu kalsanin a awm ang a, Askelon khua chu tihṭiauvin a awm dâwn si a; Chhûn laiah Asdod khu an hnawt chhuak ang a, Ekron khua chu pawh chhuahin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipui kama chêng Kereth hnamte chu an chung a pik e! Aw Kanaan, Philistia mite ram, Lalpa thu chu i chungah a lo thleng a ni: “Luahtu awm lo khawpin ka tiboral ang che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, tuipui kam te chu hnim hring hmun a ni ang a, Berâmpute bûk khuarna leh berâmte huang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, tuipui kam chu Juda chhûngtea la awm chhunte tân a ni ang a; Chûngah chuan an berâm rualte chu an tla ang a, Tlai lamah chuan Askelon khaw inahte an riak ang; Lalpa an Pathian chuan a rawn tlawh ang a, An sal tânna chu a lehlinsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Moab deuna leh Amon fate au khumna, ka mite an deuna leh An ramria an intihropuina chu ka hre tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, a nuna ka nun chhûng chu, Moab chu Sodom ang a ni ang a, Amon fate chu Gomorra ang an ni ngei ngei ang; Kângṭhai hmun leh chi khur leh kumkhaw luah loh a ni ang. Ka mi la bângte chuan anni chu râllâkah an la ang a, Ka hnam la awm chhunte chuan an luah ang,” tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu chu an chapona aiah an nei dâwn a ni, Sipaihote Lalpa mite chungah an intihlena, an chêksawlh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An tân Lalpa chu ṭihbaiawm tak a ni ang a, Lei pathiante chu a ṭâm vek dâwn si a; Tin, miten amah chibai an bûk ang, Mi tinin mahni hmun ṭheuhvah, hnamte awmna zawng zawngah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nangni Ethiopia mite paw ka khandaiha thahin in awm ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, hmâr lam ram chungah a kut a lek ang a, Assuria ram a tiboral ang a, Ninevi khua a tiṭiau vang a, thlalêr angin a tiro vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a chhûngah chuan sa rual chi tin, ramsate zawng zawng an mu ang. Tuivalawng leh sakuhte pawh a ban chhîp bâwkahte an chêng ang a; Tukverhahte zai an vâwr ang; Kawngka bulahte chuan chhiatna a awm ang; Sidar thinga siamte pawh phoruang a chang ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hei hi khawpui hlim thei tak, mahni inring tak, a thinlunga, “Keimah, ka chuang ka liam hi tu mah an awm lo,” intirilru chu a ni. Sate muthmun mai atân a va ram nasa ta êm! A kal pêl apiangin an chek khum ang a, an kut an thin khum ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hel hmang leh bawlhhlawh, hnehchhiah hmang khawpui chu a chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw chu a âwih lo va, zilhna a pawm lo va; Lalpa chu a ring lo va, a Pathian lam a hnaih duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A chhûnga a hotute chu sakeibaknei rûm lai an ni a; A rorêltute chu tlai lam chinghnia an ni a, A tûk thlenga ṭhial tûr eng mah an zuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zâwlneite chu pawlawh leh bum hmangte an ni a: A puithiamten hmun thianghlim chu an tibawlhhlawh a, Dân chu an bawhchhe nasa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chhûnga Lalpa chu a fel a; khawlohna a ti lo vang; Tûk tin a rorêlna chu a tilang a, a pelh ngai lo va; Mahse, mi fel lo chuan zah nachâng rêng a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hnamte chu ka tibo daih a, an kulhte a ram a; An kawtthlêrte chu tu ma kal tlang loh nân ka tiram a; An khawpuite chu a chhe ta; Chutichuan, tu mah an awm ta lo va, luahtu rêng an awm tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Nangin mi hlau phawt la, zilhna hi lo pawm la; Tichuan, ama chungchânga ka ruat zawng zawngte ang khân, A awmna chu tihbo daih a ni lo vang,’ ka ti a. Mahse, zîngah an tho va, an thiltih zawng zawng an tikhawlo vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, râllâk la tûra ka thawh ni thlengin mi nghâk rawh u,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: “Ka thiltum chu, an chunga ka thinurna, Ka thinurna hlauhawm tak mai chu leih tûra Lalna ramte inkhâwmtîra, hnamte koh khâwm hi a ni a; Lei zawng zawng hi ka thîkna meiah a la kâng fai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan mipuite chu hmui thianghlim ka puttîr leh ang, Lalpa hming chu an zaa an lama, thu khat vuaa a rawng an bâwl tlân theih nân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ethiopia lui piah lam aṭangin ka hnêna dîltute, ka mi darhte fanu chuan ka thilhlan an rawn la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan ka chunga i bawhchhiatna thiltih avângte chuan i zak tawh lo vang, Chumi hunah chuan i chhûng ata i mi, chapona hlimpuitute chu ka la bo vang a, Ka tlâng thianghlimah hian chapo hmangin i awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I chhûng ata mi retheite leh Tihduhdah tuarte chu ka zuah ang a, Lalpa hming chu an ring ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi la awm chhunte chuan khawlohna an ti lo vang a, Dâwt an sawi hek lo vang; An kaah pawh bumna ṭawng a awm hek lo vang; An eiin an mu ang a, tu mahin an tihlau tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Zion fanu, zai rawh; aw Israel, au vak vak rawh; Aw Jerusalem fanu, i thinlung zawng zawngin lâwm la, hlim rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpan i chungchâng rêlnate chu a la bo ta a, I hmêlma a paih chhuak ta. Israel Lalber, Lalpa pawh chu i hnênah a awm e; Thil ṭha lo i hlau ngai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Jerusalem hnênah, “Hlau suh, aw Zion, I kut pawh zawi suh se,” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“ Lalpa i Pathian chu i hnênah a awm e, Chhandamtu tûr mi chak tak chu; Lâwmin i chungah a hlim ang a, a hmangaihna a tithar ang a, Hla sain i chungah a lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangmaha mi, inkhâwmpuia tel pha lova lungngaite chu Ka hruai khâwm ang, nangmah avânga sawichhiatna phurrit phurtute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai rawh, chumi hunah chuan nghaisatu zawng zawng che kha ka ngaihtuah ang; Tin, kebai chu ka chhandam ang a, Hnawh bova awm chu ka hruai khâwm ang; Tin, lei chung zawng zawnga an lo mualphona chu, Fakna leh hmingthannaah ka chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan ka hruai lût ang che u a, Chumi hunah chuan ka hruai khâwm ang che u; In hmuh ngeia in sal tânna ka lamlêt hunah chuan, Lei chunga mi zawng zawng zîngah Hmingthanna leh fakna ka siamsak dâwn si che u a,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
</usx>
